WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.600
The app starts with a single workspace.

00:01.600 --> 00:07.000
Saved workspaces are listed under Workspace ▸ Open saved.

00:07.000 --> 00:21.600
Code: files, a Git diff preview and a terminal running a coding agent (opencode).

00:21.600 --> 00:31.000
Ops: a server log in the Preview pane next to its folder.

00:31.000 --> 00:36.800
Media: an image folder with an image preview.

00:36.800 --> 00:54.400
Each workspace is a tab with its own layout. Switch between them with one click.

00:54.400 --> 01:10.000
Change the layout of the current workspace, for example with a Markdown preview…

01:10.000 --> 01:20.000
…and choose Workspace ▸ Save Workspace to keep it.

01:20.000 --> 01:30.400
Saved workspaces stay in the Open saved list, also after restarting the app.
